  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Disability Rights Accountability, Governance and Coordination in Zimbabwe- Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building on knowledge and the lessons learnt from the current Zimbabwe UNPRPD Round 3 Project, UNESCO will lead the UNCT Team to prepare the formulation of the Round 4 Project. This will entail (i) Induction Workshop for the UN and its stakeholders; (ii) Situational Analysis on Disabilities ; and (iii) Formulation of the full-fledged project document.</narrative>
  </description>
